PRIVACY POLICY
Last updated April 2026

This Privacy Notice for GideON Charge Private Limited ("we", "us", or "our") describes how and why we may access, collect, store, use, and/or share ("process") your personal information when you use our services ("Services"), including when you:

• Download and use our mobile application (GideON)
• Use GideON - Unified EV Charging to discover, book, and charge your EV across India
• Engage with us in other related ways, including support, marketing, or events

GideON is an EV charging aggregator platform that allows users to locate nearby charging stations, check availability, start charging sessions, and make payments seamlessly across multiple networks.

If you have any questions, contact us at: [connect@gideoncharge.com](mailto:connect@gideoncharge.com)

---

SUMMARY OF KEY POINTS

We collect personal information such as your name, phone number, email address, and location to provide our services.
We do not collect sensitive personal data.
We use your information for app functionality, support, analytics, and security.
We do not sell your personal data.
Payments are processed securely through third-party providers.

---

1. WHAT INFORMATION DO WE COLLECT?

Personal information you provide to us:
• Name
• Phone number
• Email address

Sensitive Information:
We do not collect or process sensitive personal information.

Application Data:
• Location Data (Precise Location): Used to show nearby EV chargers and enable core features
• Push Notifications: Used for updates related to your account and charging sessions

Automatically Collected Information:
We may collect technical data such as:
• IP address
• Device information
• App usage data
• Location (based on device settings)

---

2. HOW DO WE PROCESS YOUR INFORMATION?

We process your data to:
• Create and manage user accounts
• Provide EV charging services
• Enable payments and transactions
• Respond to user support requests
• Improve app performance and features
• Ensure security and prevent fraud

---

3. PAYMENTS

All payments are processed securely through third-party payment providers (such as Razorpay).
We do not store or have access to your payment card details, UPI credentials, or bank account information.

---

4. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

We may use trusted third-party services to operate our app, including:
• Payment providers
• Analytics tools
• Map and location services

These services may collect and process data according to their own privacy policies.

---

5. ANALYTICS

We may use analytics tools to understand user behavior, improve features, and enhance user experience.
This data is used only for internal purposes and not for advertising or tracking.

---

6. LOCATION USAGE

Location data is used solely to help users discover nearby EV charging stations and enable app functionality.
We do not use location data for advertising or tracking.

---

7. WHEN AND WITH WHOM DO WE SHARE YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION?

We may share your data only in the following cases:
• With service providers necessary to operate the app
• During business transfers (e.g., merger or acquisition)
• To comply with legal obligations

We do not sell your personal data.

---

8. HOW LONG DO WE KEEP YOUR INFORMATION?

We retain your data only as long as necessary to provide services and comply with legal obligations.
When no longer needed, data is deleted or anonymized.

---

9. HOW DO WE KEEP YOUR INFORMATION SAFE?

We implement reasonable technical and organizational security measures.
However, no system is 100% secure, and use of the app is at your own risk.

---

10. DO WE COLLECT INFORMATION FROM MINORS?

We do not knowingly collect data from users under 18 years of age.

